							<table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody><tr><td class="ContentBoxBody"> <div align="center"><font color="#0000ff"><b>Enchanter Epic</b></font><br /> </div> The Start</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Erudin - Talk to Stofo Olan (loc neg 1105, neg 63) on 2nd floor of Vasty Deep Inn</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Copy of Notes 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Qeynos Aqueducts - Find Reania Jukle (loc pos 2028, neg 579) in Temple in Sewers. Use illusion Human and Collaboration to talk to her - Receive an Empty Ink Vial</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Copy of Notes 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Lower Guk - Find the Ghoul Scribe - Wan Knight is placeholder (loc pos 540, neg 710, neg 190). Charm him and give him the Empty Ink Vial - Receive Ink of the Dark.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Copy of Notes 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Lower Guk - Find and kill Arch Ghoul Magi while in in Lower Guk - Loot Shiny Metallic Robe</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Copy of Notes 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Ak'anon - Talk to Rilgor Plegnog (loc pos 2031, neg 585) in The Mines of Malfunction. Give Rilgor the Shiny Metallic Robe - Receive Mechanical Pen</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Copy of Notes 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Buy A Piece of Parchment and Quill - can be bought in Qeynos</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Copy of Notes 6</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">West Karana - Find Chrislin Baker (loc pos 1043, neg 1995). Give her paper &amp; quill - Receive Bandit Sash. Thrakin Griften will spawn (loc pos 880, neg 11570) (lvl 55 warrior, resistant to magic based spells, cannot be rooted, snared or slowed). Kill Thrakin - Loot a White Paper</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Copy of Notes 7</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Erudin - Give Stofo Olan the Ink of the Dark, Mechanical Pen and a White Paper - Receive a Copy of Notes.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Jeb's Seal</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Burning Woods - Talk to Jeb Lumsed aka a Sarnak imitator (loc neg 1200 neg 4000). He spawns 72 hours after server reset and does not despawn. Make sure you have an inventory slot open. Give the Copy of Notes to Jeb - Receive a coin called Jeb's Seal.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Illusion 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Overthere - Talk to Modani Qu'Loni (loc pos 538, neg 936) near Scorpion Temple. Give Jeb's Seal to Modani - Receive Jeb's Seal back and an Enchanter's Bag. Say "I am ready to collect them". He will tell you what to bring him in order to find the hidden self inside a myriad of magic.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Illusion 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Felwithe - Talk to Joren Nobleheart in the Mage Guild. Say "I have been sent by the King." and then "Yes, I accept the Kings order.". He wants the head of a prince</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Illusion 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Chardok - Find Prince Selrach Di'zok. Kill the Prince - Loot Head of a Prince.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Illusion 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Felwithe - Give Joren Nobleheart the Head of a Prince - Receive the Chalice of Kings (+5cha, +5int, +5vs.magic, +5vs.fire, +5vs.cold, +5vs.disease, +5vs.poison)</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Illusion 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">East Cabilis - Find Vessil Drozlin (loc pos 591, neg 826) in East Cabilis Sewers. He is a lvl 60 Shadowknight. Kill Vessil - Loot Rod of Xolion (1hb, 9/30, +3int, +3agi, +20mana, +5vs.magic)</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Illusion 6</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Ogguk - Go to where Brokk Boxtripper is found (loc pos 220, pos 380, pos 60). Pick up Large Muddy Sandals. Find and talk to Bozlum Blossum (loc pos 540, pos 1160, 80). Give her the Large Muddy Sandals - Receive a Scribbled Parchment. Go back to Brokk Boxtripper. Give him a Scribbled Parchment - Receive a Gift to Bozlum. Go back to Bozlum and give her the Gift to Bozlum - Receive Snow Blossoms</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody><tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody"><br /> </td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody"> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Illusion 7</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Neriak 3rd Gate - Find Verina Tomb (loc pos 412, neg 810) in Clerics Guild Castle. She is a lvl 60 DE Cleric. Kill Verina - Loot Innoruuk's Word (+10cha &amp; +5int)</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Illusion 8</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">East Cabilis - Find Vessil Drozlin (loc pos 591, neg 826) in East Cabilis Sewers. He is a lvl 60 Shadowknight. Kill Vessil - Loot Rod of Xolion (1hb, 9/30, +3int, +3agi, +20mana, +5vs.magic)</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Illusion 9</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Overthere - Return to Modani Qu'Loni. Combine the Chalice of Kings, Rod of Xolion, Snow Blossoms and Innoruuk's Word in the Enchanter's Bag - Receive a Sack for Modani. Give a Sack for Modani to Modani - Receive 1st Piece of Staff</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Enlightenment 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Ak'anon - Hail a Clockwork VIIX aka Mizzle Gepple (loc pos 2022, neg 520) in The Mines of Malfunction. Say "Are you Mizzle?". Give her Jeb's Seal - Receive Jeb's Seal back and an Enchanter's Bag.Say to Mizzle "I am ready to collect the required components". She will tell you what to bring to her to receive true clarity.</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Enlightenment 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Oasis of Marr - Kill Sand Giants to spawn Cazel, a lvl 55 sand giant with regeneration capabilities. Kill Cazel - Loot A Spoon</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Enlightenment 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Overthere - Go to loc neg 187, neg 377 and pick up The One Key (spawn time 24 hrs) which can be found lying on the ground on top of the mesa, looks like a bag</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Enlightenment 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Dalnir's Crypt - Very close to the exit at the bottom is a room with a bookshelf (loc neg 18, pos 54). If you sit around long enough, a Kly Cohort will walk in and say "Where is that scroll?". Look between bed and wall - Pick up The Lost Scroll</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Enlightenment 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Plane of Sky - To get to the Efreeti room get a port up to the first island in Sky. Buy the 1cp key. Use the key on the middle teleport pad. This will put you in the Efreeti room. Pick up the book of Charm and Sacrifice from the table near the Reckless Efreeti spawn. (The efreeti do not agro so you can just pick up the book and leave at your leisure. The only way out of the room is to jump out of the zone.)</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Enlightenment 6</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Ak'anon - Return to a Clockwork VIIX aka Mizzle Gepple. Combine A Spoon, The One Key, The Lost Scroll and the book of Charm and Sacrifice in the Enchanter's Bag - Receive a Sack for Mizzle. Give a Sack for Mizzle to Mizzle - Receive 2nd Piece of Staff.</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Charm 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Firiona Vie - Hail Nadia Starfeast (loc neg 3870, pos 2525) near the Magician's Guild. Give her Jeb's Seal - Receive Jeb's Seal back and an Enchanter's Bag.Ask Nadia Starfeast "What gems?" and she will mention 4 gems: diamond, sapphire, ruby and emerald. Ask about each gem and she will hand a dull gem to you. "What diamond?" - Receive a Dull Diamond. "What sapphire?" - Receive a Dull Sapphire. "What ruby?" - Receive a Dull Ruby. "What emerald?" - Receive a Dull Emerald. She will need for you to trap the essence of four special creatures.</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Charm 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Kaesora - Find the Spectral Librarian, referred to as a bookworm, (loc pos 85, neg 415) whose placeholder is the Tortured Librarian. Charm the Spectral Librarian and give her the Dull Diamond - Receive an Enchanted Diamond. This will spawn the Enraged Spectral Librarian. You do not have to kill the Enraged Spectral Librarian, you can gate/port out after receiving the Enchanted Diamond.</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Charm 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Skyfire - Find Felia Goldenwing, referred to as the Golden Faerie, (loc pos 1550, neg 1000) near Burning Woods zone. Charm her and give her Dull Sapphire - Receive an Enchanted Sapphire. **Note that mobs in the zone agro on her and will kill her shortly after she spawns.</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Charm 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">City of Mist - Find the Wraith of Jaxion in the last building where Neh' Ashiir spawns, placeholder is a roamer. Charm him and give him Dull Ruby - Receive an Enchanted Ruby.</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Charm 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Overthere - Find Impaler Tzilug, lvl 51 named Scorpikis with five guardians (loc neg 91, pos 814). Charm him and give him Dull Emerald - Receive an Enchanted Emerald</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of Charm 6</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Firiona Vie - Return to Nadia Starfeast. Combine the Enchanted Diamond, Enchanted Sapphire, Enchanted Ruby and Enchanted Emerald in the Enchanter's Bag - Receive a Sack for Nadia. Give a Sack for Nadia to Nadia - Receive 3rd Piece of Staff</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of the Phantasm 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Hole - Talk to Polzin Mrid (loc pos 210, neg 50, neg 350) in the garden behind one of the shops in the elemental city. Give him Jeb's Seal - Receive Jeb's Seal back and an Enchanter's Bag. Say "I am ready for the test of the phantasm." He will tell you which items he needs for you to bring to him to complete the test of the phantasm.</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of the Phantasm 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Hole - find The Ghost of Kindle who spawns at the top of the undead tower right before the entrance to Master Yael's lair. Kill her - Loot Essence of a Ghost <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of the Phantasm 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Plane of Fear - Find the Wraith of a Shissar (spawn time random 2-108+ hours). Kill the Wraith - Loot Head of the Serpent.</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of the Phantasm 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Plane of Hate - Find a Forsaken Revanant (both male and female). Kill them - Loot Essence of a Vampire</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of the Phantasm 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Field of Bone - Find Tangrin (loc pos 3500, pos 2800), a lvl 54 ape with Monkey Stun. Kill Tangrin - Loot Sands of the Mystics</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Test of the Phantasm 6</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Firiona Vie - Return to Polzin Mrid.. Combine the Head of the Serpent, Essence of a Vampire, Sands of the Mystics and Essence of a Ghost in the Enchanter's Bag - Receive a Sack for Polzin. Give a Sack for Polzin to Polzin - Receive 4th Piece of Staff</td></tr></tbody></table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Weapon</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Burning Woods - Return to Jeb Lumsed aka a Sarnak imitator. *Make sure you have an Enchanter's Bag on you. Combine the 1st Piece of Staff, 2nd Piece of Staff, 3rd Piece of Staff and 4th Piece of Staff in the Enchanter's Bag - Receive a Bundle of Staves.Give Jeb Lumsed a Bundle of Staves - Receive *Staff of the Serpent*</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody> </table> 
							
